app.Q2FyZ29YbWw.action.YnVpbGQtY2FyZ28te.source:
The message payload to serialize. The top-level key must be the message's qualified element name with the appropriate `xmlns` declarations on `^attributes^`. Nested elements are nested keys; attributes go under `^attributes^`; text content goes under `^value^`.

**Example** (UN/CEFACT Cross-Industry Order):
```
{
  "rsm:CrossIndustryOrder": {
    "^attributes^": {"xmlns:rsm": "urn:un:unece:uncefact:data:standard:CrossIndustryOrder:27"},
    "rsm:ExchangedDocument": { ... },
    "rsm:SupplyChainTradeTransaction": { ... }
  }
}
```

app.Q2FyZ29YbWw.action.YnVpbGQtY2FyZ28te.message:
要序列化的訊息有效負載。頂層索引鍵必須是訊息的限定元素名稱，並在 `^attributes^` 上帶有適當的 `xmlns` 宣告。巢狀元素為巢狀索引鍵；屬性位於 `^attributes^` 下；文字內容位於 `^value^` 下。

**範例**（UN/CEFACT 跨行業訂單）：
```
{
  "rsm:CrossIndustryOrder": {
    "^attributes^": {"xmlns:rsm": "urn:un:unece:uncefact:data:standard:CrossIndustryOrder:27"},
    "rsm:ExchangedDocument": { ... },
    "rsm:SupplyChainTradeTransaction": { ... }
  }
}
```
